---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Records | The Catch" current="Records">
  <div slot="locator" class="locator"><span>RECORDS</span><span>Primary documents</span></div>
  <div class="content">
    <main class="records-index">
      <h1>Records</h1>
      <p class="lede">Primary documents we have captured, quoted, and checked. Each record shows the source's
      own words with a link to the original.</p>

      <h2>June 17, 2026 &middot; Federal funds rate decision</h2>
      <ul class="rec-list">
        <li><a href="/claims/fomc-statement-june-17-2026-rate-range-maintained/">
          <span class="rec-title">FOMC statement: decision day</span>
          <span class="rec-meta">Federal Reserve &middot; the 12&ndash;0 hold at 3.50&ndash;3.75 percent, in the Committee's words</span></a></li>
        <li><a href="/claims/fomc-minutes-june-17-2026-rate-range-maintained/">
          <span class="rec-title">FOMC minutes: the discussion behind it</span>
          <span class="rec-meta">Federal Reserve &middot; released July 8 &middot; the vote roster and the case a few made for a hike</span></a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="idx-more">These records are analyzed together on the
      <a href="/events/federal-funds-rate-decision-2026-06-17/">event page</a>. Date archive:
      <a href="/records/2026/06/17/">June 17, 2026</a>.</p>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .records-index { max-width: 44rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
  .records-index h1 { font-family: "Newsreader", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 2rem; margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem; }
  .records-index .lede { font-family: "Newsreader", Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #3c434b; }
  .records-index h2 { font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #5b6470; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; }
  .rec-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .rec-list a { display: block; border: 1px solid #e3e0da; padding: 0.8rem 1rem; text-decoration: none; color: inherit; background: #fbfaf8; }
  .rec-list a:hover { border-color: #b9b4aa; }
  .rec-title { display: block; font-weight: 700; font-family: "Newsreader", Georgia, serif; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .rec-meta { display: block; font-family: "Public Sans", system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #5b6470; margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  .idx-more { font-family: "Public Sans", system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #5b6470; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
</style>
